# 统一行尾策略：文本文件仓库内统一存 LF，检出也用 LF（消除 LF/CRLF 转换警告）
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须用 CRLF，否则部分语法块可能解析异常
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 图片/音频等二进制文件不做任何行尾处理
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.zip binary
*.apk binary
*.keystore binary
